    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Duffy is proud to launch Bayview Affordable Homes — a superb new Affordable Homes Scheme delivered in partnership with Wonderglade Homes and Louth County Council on the highly sought-after Red Barns Road, Dundalk.\n\nBayview presents an exciting opportunity for eligible purchasers to access beautifully crafted, energy-efficient homes through the Affordable Purchase Scheme, combining exceptional value with contemporary living in one of Dundalk's most desirable locations. Developed by Wonderglade Homes, Bayview has been designed to create a vibrant new community with quality, comfort and convenience at its heart.\n\nRegistration opens on 22nd June with prices starting at 276,235. Link - https://affordablehomes.ie/buy/bayview/\n\nFor further information, visit https://www.louthcoco.ie/en/services/housing/affordable-purchase-scheme/\n\nThis development also qualifies for the Help to Buy (HTB) scheme, making homeownership significantly more accessible for eligible first-time buyers.\n\nWelcome to Bayview, a thoughtfully designed collection of contemporary A-rated homes nestled in one of Dundalk's most desirable residential areas. This exclusive new development offers a superb mix of detached and semi-detached properties, tailored to meet the needs of first-time buyers, growing families, and anyone seeking a fresh, modern lifestyle within reach of town, coast, and commuter routes.\n\nAn Exceptional Location\nSet along the leafy and well-established Red Barns Road, Bayview enjoys an enviable position just minutes from Dundalk town centre, with its vibrant selection of shops, cafés, schools, and leisure facilities. Residents will benefit from quick access to the M1 motorway, making commuting to Dublin, Belfast or beyond exceptionally convenient. Dundalk Train Station and nearby bus routes provide further public transport options, while the nearby coastal village of Blackrock offers a scenic escape for weekend walks, coffee, or sea views.\n\nModern Living Redefined\nEvery home at Bayview is designed with contemporary living in mind — blending practical layouts with elegant finishes and energy-efficient technologies. Expect spacious rooms, smart floorplans, stylish kitchens and bathrooms, and A-rated energy performance throughout. Each home includes air-to-water heat pump systems, double-glazed uPVC windows, Ultratech engineered hardwood front doors, and a host of premium finishes to ensure long-term comfort and sustainability.\n\nStylish Homes for Every Stage of Life\nAvailable in a variety of 2, 3 and 4-bedroom layouts, the homes at Bayview offer a high standard of living across the board. From soft-close kitchen cabinetry and integrated appliances, to fully tiled bathrooms, utility rooms, and generous private gardens, every detail has been considered. The development also features attractive landscaping and green open spaces to enhance the sense of community.\n\nWith homes now available for purchase, this is your opportunity to secure a place in one of Dundalk's most exciting and well-located new communities.\n\nDon't miss out — register your interest with DNG Duffy today and take the next step toward your future at Bayview.\n\nDisclaimer:\nThese particulars do not form part of any offer or contract. All statements are provided for informational purposes only and should not be relied upon as representations of fact. Intending purchasers must independently verify the accuracy of each statement through inspection or other means. Configurations of kitchens, bathrooms, wardrobes, and other features may be subject to change without prior notice. Purchasers are advised to confirm the current specification at the time of booking. Neither the Vendor, Selling Agent, nor any of their employees or representatives have the authority to make or give any representation or warranty in relation to any property.\n\nImages and artist's impressions are for illustrative purposes only. Floor plans are not to scale, and all dimensions are approximate. The development name is used solely for marketing purposes and may not be adopted as the official street name by the local council."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> A-rated energy-efficient homes with air-to-water heat pump systems</li><li> Excellent location close to Dundalk town centre, Blackrock, and the M1 motorway</li><li> Detached and semi-detached homes in a variety of 2, 3 and 4-bedroom designs</li><li> Stylish contemporary kitchens with soft-close cabinetry and integrated appliances</li><li> Fully tiled bathrooms with high-quality fittings and finishes</li><li> Private rear gardens, seeded lawns, and French-style patio doors</li><li> Ultratech engineered hardwood front doors and uPVC double-glazed windows</li><li> Landscaped open spaces creating a welcoming, community-focused environment</ul>"
